abstract: Fifteen multilingual, offline-ready interactive AI labs spanning thirteen Foundations/course-track mechanisms and two Modern AI extensions. v1.7.2 completes mature product-shell, learner-support, Quick Assign packet, accessibility-text, provenance, and discovery-metadata parity for the Transformer, agent, and Minimax labs while preserving all fifteen mechanisms, assignments, languages, privacy boundaries, and curriculum roles.
